        "pageid": 75697310,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Astlibra Revision",
        "extract": "Astlibra Revision is a 2D RPG side-scrolling action role-playing video game released on Nintendo Switch in November 2023, created by a solo Japanese video game developer KEIZO but with an initial release via free demo in February 2021 and via Steam on 13 October 2022. Its creator said that it took 16 years to develop. According to Nintendo Life, KEIZO was a \"humble Japanese salaryman\" who \"started work on Astlibra because he felt there weren’t enough 2D action RPG games that filled the niche he most enjoyed\".\nA DLC expansion, titled Astlibra Gaiden: The Cave of Phantom Mist, was released on 13 February 2024 for Windows. A standalone version was released for Nintendo Switch on 17 October 2024.",
